https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework

The Diátaxis documentation is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

This Agent Skill was adapted and condensed by **Ian Corvin** in 2026.

The adaptation converts Diátaxis concepts and documentation guidance into
instructions for an AI agent that reviews a single documentation page or
fragment. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Diátaxis project or
Daniele Procida.